[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18431.43, "timestamp": "05:07:11", "text": "嗯？嗯，真丑。这就是原因。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18434.868, "timestamp": "05:07:14", "text": "就是那种装饰性的东西。是啊，我有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18437.83, "timestamp": "05:07:17", "text": "明白为什么。而且，它还有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18441.628, "timestamp": "05:07:21", "text": "旧版战斗通行证的重新设计"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18444.75, "timestamp": "05:07:24", "text": "皮肤。它有点像在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18447.83, "timestamp": "05:07:27", "text": "方式。这不会是那么容易发生的。仅有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18450.15, "timestamp": "05:07:30", "text": "是粉笔，对吧？那是唯一的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18452.27, "timestamp": "05:07:32", "text": "粉笔是唯一的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18454.708, "timestamp": "05:07:34", "text": "反应性。这就是为什么人们说它是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18456.43, "timestamp": "05:07:36", "text": "丑陋的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18458.35, "timestamp": "05:07:38", "text": "东西或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18466.948, "timestamp": "05:07:46", "text": "知道。我看过它的游戏演示。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18472.948, "timestamp": "05:07:52", "text": "好像有人会把钱花在这上面似的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18476.39, "timestamp": "05:07:56", "text": "不过，总的来说，唯一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18478.948, "timestamp": "05:07:58", "text": "我喜欢这次活动的原因是……"}]